<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 89,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 89,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Friday were 89,000 head, compared with 95,000 a week earlier. Saturday's  actual receipts were 14,000 head, compared with the estimate of 15,000.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts steady to $0.50 per cwt higher than midsession Friday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
