<p>few				 58.00		    59.00</p>
<p>Sows:  500 dn steady to 1.00 higher, 500 up generally steady. US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  43.00 -45.50	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -45.50	   44.00 -46.50</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.00 -49.00</p>
